#. module: photography
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:photography.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Accounting</strong>: do more than simple invoicing - with Odoo "
"Accounting, you can generate tax reports, manage your invoices and bills and"
" even synchronize payments from your bank account automatically"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Računovodstvo</strong>: naredite več kot le preprosto izdajanje "
"računov – z Odoo Računovodstvom lahko ustvarjate davčna poročila, upravljate "
"izdane in prejete račune ter celo samodejno sinhronizirate plačila s svojim "
"bančnim računom"

#. module: photography
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:photography.ir_ui_view_1960
msgid ""
"<strong>And more</strong>: Whatever your occasion or preference, I can help "
"you create photos that suit your needs and expectations."
msgstr ""
"<strong>In še več</strong>: Ne glede na vašo priložnost ali želje vam lahko "
"pomagam ustvariti fotografije, ki ustrezajo vašim potrebam in pričakovanjem."

#. module: photography
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:photography.ir_ui_view_1959
msgid ""
"<strong>Attract and retain talent</strong> by showcasing your company "
"culture and work environment;"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Privabite in obdržite talente</strong> s predstavljanjem kulture "
"vašega podjetja in delovnega okolja;"

#. module: photography
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:photography.ir_ui_view_1960
msgid ""
"<strong>Baby portraits</strong>: Capture the cuteness and innocence of your "
"baby with adorable photos that will make you smile every time you look at "
"them;"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Portreti dojenčkov</strong>: Ujemite ljubkost in nedolžnost svojega "
"dojenčka z ljubkimi fotografijami, ki vas bodo nasmejale vsakič, ko jih "
"boste pogledali;"

#. module: photography
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:photography.ir_ui_view_1959
msgid ""
"<strong>Enhance your reputation and credibility</strong> by documenting your"
" achievements and social responsibility;"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Izboljšajte svoj ugled in verodostojnost</strong> z dokumentiranjem "
"svojih dosežkov in družbene odgovornosti;"

#. module: photography
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:photography.ir_ui_view_1960
msgid ""
"<strong>Family portraits</strong>: Preserve your precious memories and show "
"your family bond with stunning photos that you can cherish for years to "
"come;"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Družinski portreti</strong>: Ohranite svoje dragocene spomine in "
"pokažite svojo družinsko povezanost z osupljivimi fotografijami, ki jih "
"boste lahko cenili še leta;"

#. module: photography
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:photography.ir_ui_view_1959
msgid ""
"<strong>Increase your sales and conversions</strong> by highlighting your "
"products’ features and benefits;"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Povečajte svojo prodajo in konverzije</strong> s poudarjanjem "
"značilnosti in prednosti svojih izdelkov;"

#. module: photography
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:photography.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Planning</strong>: manage plannings for team members and resources, "
"like a studio room or some hardware"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Načrtovanje</strong>: upravljajte razporede za člane ekipe in vire, "
"kot sta studijski prostor ali strojna oprema"

#. module: photography
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:photography.ir_ui_view_1960
msgid ""
"<strong>Professional portraits</strong>: Impress your clients and employers "
"with polished and confident photos that reflect your personal brand and "
"expertise;"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Profesionalni portreti</strong>: Navdušite svoje stranke in "
"delodajalce z dovršenimi in samozavestnimi fotografijami, ki odražajo vašo "
"osebno blagovno znamko in strokovno znanje;"

#. module: photography
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:photography.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Sign</strong>: send contracts to prospects and get the full "
"traceability of their online signature"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Podpis</strong>: pošljite pogodbe potencialnim strankam in pridobite "
"popolno sledljivost njihovih spletnih podpisov"

#. module: photography
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:photography.ir_ui_view_1959
msgid ""
"<strong>Strengthen your relationships and loyalty</strong> by sharing your "
"stories and emotions."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Okrepite svoje odnose in zvestobo</strong> tako, da delite svoje "
"zgodbe in čustva."

